{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"glsl","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"GLSL and HLSL shaders","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for GLSL and HLSL shaders (.glsl .vert .frag .geom).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"glsl","name":"GLSL and HLSL shaders","extensions":[".glsl",".vert",".frag",".geom",".comp",".hlsl",".fx",".wgsl"],"grammar":"grammars/glsl.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"GLSL and HLSL shaders","path":"snippets/glsl.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/glsl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"^\\\\s*#\\\\s*[a-z]+.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\bgl_[A-Za-z]+|\\\\bSV_[A-Za-z]+\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:attribute|precision|technique|continue|discard|mediump|uniform|varying|cbuffer|layout|return|smooth|struct|switch|buffer|shared|break|const|highp|inout|while|else|flat|lowp|pass|for|out|do|if|in)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:SamplerState|samplerCube|sampler2D|sampler3D|Texture2D|float4x4|double|float2|float3|float4|float|ivec2|ivec3|ivec4|uvec2|uvec3|uvec4|bvec2|bvec3|bvec4|bool|uint|void|vec2|vec3|vec4|mat2|mat3|mat4|half|int)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:smoothstep|normalize|texture2D|transpose|distance|saturate|reflect|refract|texture|inverse|length|clamp|cross|floor|fract|acos|asin|atan|sign|sqrt|step|lerp|abs|cos|dot|exp|log|max|min|mix|mod|pow|sin|tan|mul)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/glsl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Fragment shader\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"frag\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#version ${1:330 core}\",\n      \"out vec4 fragColor;\",\n      \"in vec2 uv;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"void main() {\",\n      \"\\tfragColor = vec4($0);\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A fragment shader\"\n  },\n  \"Vertex shader\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"vert\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#version ${1:330 core}\",\n      \"layout(location = 0) in vec3 position;\",\n      \"uniform mat4 mvp;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"void main() {\",\n      \"\\tgl_Position = mvp * vec4(position, 1.0);\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A vertex shader\"\n  },\n  \"Uniform\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"uni\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"uniform ${1:float} ${2:name};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A uniform\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# GLSL and HLSL shaders\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for GLSL and HLSL shaders.\n\n## Files\n\n`.glsl`, `.vert`, `.frag`, `.geom`, `.comp`, `.hlsl`, `.fx`, `.wgsl`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `frag` | A fragment shader |\n| `vert` | A vertex shader |\n| `uni` | A uniform |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}